  "question": {
    "text": "The value of <math><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Putting&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math>&nbsp;, we get,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Now by L-Hospital rule<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Again by L-Hospital rule<br /><math><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>"
  }
